<title>USA: Abbott Laboratories Inc Q3 net higher.</title>
<headline>Abbott Laboratories Inc Q3 net higher.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH CHICAGO, Ill. 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		   $     0.54		   $ 0.48</p>
<p> Net			420,887		  382,051</p>
<p> Revs		   2,646,194		2,390,753</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 779,665		  793,385</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>	  NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 1.75		   $ 1.53</p>
<p> Net		    1,371,419		1,223,335</p>
<p> Revs		   8,017,611		7,415,460</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 782,915		  797,321</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q3 sales unfavorably impacted 2.6 percent due to the effect of the relatively stronger U.S. dollar.</p>
<p>Q3 and nine months net includes losses on foreign exchange in 1996 of $4.5 million and $17.7 million respectively; and in 1995 of $3.5 million and $19 million respectively.</p>
<p>Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787</p>
